.org/data/definitions/78.html](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/78.html)\n - [https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/95.html)\n","text":"Dynamic OS command or code execution with a non-literal argument (exec/execSync/spawn/spawnSync/eval/new Function). Untrusted input reaching these sinks enables command or code injection."},"id":"security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.command.os-command-and-eval","name":"security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.command.os-command-and-eval","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-78: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an OS Command (OS Command Injection)","CWE-95: Improper Neutralization of Directives in Dynamically Evaluated Code (Eval Injection)","MEDIUM CONFIDENCE","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.command.os-command-and-eval"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Deprecated crypto.createCipher/createDecipher used. These derive keys without an IV and are insecure; use createCipheriv/createDecipheriv with a random IV."},"help":{"markdown":"Deprecated crypto.createCipher/createDecipher used. These derive keys without an IV and are insecure; use createCipheriv/createDecipheriv with a random IV.\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/327.html](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/327.html)\n","text":"Deprecated crypto.createCipher/createDecipher used. These derive keys without an IV and are insecure; use createCipheriv/createDecipheriv with a random IV."},"id":"security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.crypto.deprecated-createcipher","name":"security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.crypto.deprecated-createcipher","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-327: Use of a Broken or Risky Cryptographic Algorithm","HIGH CONFIDENCE","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: security-audit.semgre