 without integrity checks; use COPY for local files or download with a verified checksum."},"id":"security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.dockerfile.add-remote-url","name":"security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.dockerfile.add-remote-url","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-494: Download of Code Without Integrity Check","MEDIUM CONFIDENCE","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.dockerfile.add-remote-url"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Remote script piped directly into a shell (curl|wget ... | bash/sh). Downloaded code runs without integrity verification; download, verify, then execute."},"help":{"markdown":"Remote script piped directly into a shell (curl|wget ... | bash/sh). Downloaded code runs without integrity verification; download, verify, then execute.\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/494.html](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/494.html)\n","text":"Remote script piped directly into a shell (curl|wget ... | bash/sh). Downloaded code runs without integrity verification; download, verify, then execute."},"id":"security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.dockerfile.curl-pipe-shell","name":"security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.dockerfile.curl-pipe-shell","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["CWE-494: Download of Code Without Integrity Check","MEDIUM CONFIDENCE","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: security-audit.semgrep-rules.security-audit.dockerfile.curl-pipe-shell"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Hard-coded secret default in a Dockerfile ARG/ENV (name contains SECRET/KEY/PASSWORD/TOKEN/APIKEY). Build-time secret defaults are baked into image layers; pass them at runtime instead."},"help":{"markdown":"Hard-coded secret default in a Dockerfile ARG/ENV (name contains SECRET/KEY/PASSWORD/TOKEN/APIKEY). Build-time secret defau